      </div>
      <img src="/4. Building Performance/TOP.PNG" alt="Solar shading — top view" style="width: 45%; height: auto; display: block;" />
    </div>
    <p class="bpm-img-caption">Solar shading analysis suggests that the roof and southern facade of the building receive maximum solar energy compared rest of the building.</p>

    <p class="bpm-sub-label">Thermal Profile</p>
