    <p class="bpm-sub-label">Baseline Whole-Building Performance</p>
    <p class="bpm-body">Compared to median EUI per building type in the U.S., our baseline model for Ansys Hall have a relatively high EUI of 236 kBTU/sf.</p>

    <!-- EUI results table -->
